      "id": "sol.ahsme-1992-p1.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "We have \\(8x+10\\pi=2(4x+5\\pi),\\) so \\[ \\begin{gathered} 6(8x+10\\pi)\\\\ {}=12(4x+5\\pi)\\\\ {}=4\\bigl[3(4x+5\\pi)\\bigr]\\\\ {}=4P. \\end{gathered} \\]\n\nThus the correct answer is B.",
